That's what it looks like. All the calls to exclam I can find either
pass exclam a variable named dmg or something similar, 0, or a value
returned from zhitm or bhitm, which return damage done.


At least one way to do negative damage is to cast force bolt with
int < 10. That gives a -3 penalty to damage, and it's 2d12 base, so
you could do -1 with a bit of bad luck.

